      "heading": "E — Market Signal",
      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## E — Market Signal, Section Twelve Alcohol, Drugs and Driving\n\nMarket research for this chapter stays scoped to the handbook impairment rules themselves, and no separate market study was performed for this section. No competitive intelligence artifact was supplied upstream, so no competitor teardown, pricing survey, or demand sizing is asserted here. Candidate demand, pass rates, and study-room behavior are left unmeasured rather than estimated. Any future market pack should start from the first-time-applicant audience learning impairment law and verify demand against issuer-published candidate counts before quoting figures.\n",
